OL,3,CFirefighters battle major overnight
OL,4,Cblaze
OL,6,FFire crews have worked through the
OL,7,Fnight to bring a massive fire under
OL,8,Fcontrol after a suit shop was engulfed
OL,9,Fin flames.
OL,11,FDramatic pictures and video taken at
OL,12,Fthe scene in Salford show towering
OL,13,Fflames tearing through the Marc Darcy
OL,14,Fstore on Hilton Street in the early
OL,15,Fhours of Thursday, 6 August, sending
OL,16,Fhuge plumes of smoke into the sky.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
