OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785998875
OL,3,CFirefighters battle major overnight
OL,4,Cblaze
OL,6,FStation Commander Carl Haslam, from
OL,7,FGreater Manchester Fire and Rescue
OL,8,FService (GMFRS), shared footage from
OL,9,Fthe scene and said crews had been
OL,10,F"working hard" overnight to contain
OL,11,Fthe flames.
OL,13,FEmergency services remain at the site
OL,14,Fon Hilton Street as work continues to
OL,15,Fbring the remaining flames under
OL,16,Fcontrol.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
