OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F361A1785998875
OL,3,CFirefighters battle major overnight
OL,4,Cblaze
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Greater Manchester
OL,7,FFire and Rescue Service said:
OL,8,F"Firefighters are currently tackling a
OL,9,Flarge fire at a commercial property
OL,10,Fbuilding on Hilton Street in Salford.
OL,12,F"Due to the large amount of smoke in
OL,13,Fthe area, residents are advised to
OL,14,Fkeep doors and windows closed and
OL,15,Favoid the area."
OL,17,FBury New Road remains closed in both
OL,18,Fdirections while crews work at the
OL,19,Fscene, with local drivers urged to
OL,20,Favoid the area.
